  <ScenTitle>Operation Lions Den, 1972</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Original Concept By:&lt;/B&gt; Paul Bridge&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; August 27th 1972 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Gulf of Tonkin &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; United States &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 2 Days&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Operation Linebacker was mainly carried out by air power. However naval forces were also deployed against important logistical areas and in support of ground troops. The Battle of Haiphong Harbor, or Operation Lion's Den, was one such engagement fought on 27th August, 1972. Four US Navy warships and a pair of naval attack aircraft launched a night raid against the port of Haiphong. &lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
